/Alt (Diagram of a system for position and velocity estimation. The process begins with the INS subsystem, consisting of an IMU sensor leading to error compensation and INS mechanization. Outputs are fed into a position and velocity module, then into a Kalman filter for correction, resulting in optimal estimation. The GNSS subsystem uses a GNSS antenna connected to a receiver, sharing position and velocity data into the system, combining with outputs from the INS subsystem for corrections and estimations.)
/ID (ID.0076)
/K [916 0 R 917 0 R 918 0 R 919 0 R 920 0 R 921 0 R 922 0 R]
/P 45 0 R
/S /Figure
